[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来是想去海之家的，不过……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉好尴尬啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上次我在那边哭了出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还是在那对奶子上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说实话都不知道该怎么面对她了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，在这里犹豫不决也没什么意义。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“店里已经收拾得差不多了，应该马上就可以开业了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那个瞬间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我真的很想去亲眼见证一下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“走吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i364"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你好……我是鹰原。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你好，我是水织～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎么了羽依里，为什么突然这么见外啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，就是……那个嘛，上次让你看到了那么难堪的一面……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且，还摸到了奶子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“难堪的一面？是指什么事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是指趴在我的奶子上大哭那件事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我倒是希望你已经忘了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哼哼～♪不是说过不会忘记的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这件事求你还是忘掉吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13797"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因为是第一次看到男生哭，我还小小心动了一下呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13924"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“更何况还是在奶子上哭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你们好～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀紬，欢迎♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你好，羽依里先生！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喔，你好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生，总感觉你的脸好红呀？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14460"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是晒伤了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之前我露出了不堪入目的一面，刚才我们正好在聊呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14526"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“原来如此……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14522"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是裸体之类的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是那种不堪入目。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那是什么样的……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13930"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这是秘密哦♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14532"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13924"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过，紬也会有自己的秘密吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13898"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“拥有谜团和秘密，才会让人更加帅气哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“原来如此……这么一说，羽依里先生确实显得更帅气了一些。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“本来就很帅气，但现在更帅气了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13930"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊，很帅气呢。越来越帅气了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别这样，我好害羞……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“倒不如说，我觉得自己是展露出了很丢脸的一面。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是说了些泄气的话……在静久面前大哭了一场。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊，把脸埋在我的奶子里哭了起来呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14450"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14530"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“把脸埋在静久的奶子里会喘不过气来……而且还挣脱不了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14486"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我也体会过……所以可以理解。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我都哭到奶子湿漉漉的了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“把你弄哭过呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，倒不是因为憋气才哭的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“所以说，这并不丢脸哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……算了，就这样吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之先来打扫卫生吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要再努力一下，海之家就可以开业迎客了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"三个人一起将海之家打扫得干净整洁。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14422"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“接下来……要把这边的垃圾清理一下……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"店里面的旗子也试着立了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“逐渐开始有店铺的样子了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i365"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……差不多就这种感觉吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14383"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是呢～看起来焕然一新，心情好舒畅呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，海之家重获了新生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……虽然只是表面上的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"三人一起鼓掌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在这时。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“那个……稍微打扰你们一下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？……――啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个人是之前捡垃圾时碰到的――"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“我这里可不是垃圾场。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“可以不要在我家门前做这种事吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i365"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――那个批评了我们的人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14492"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13879"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“请问有什么事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们三人明明还很开心的来着……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“呃……那个……我想跟你们道个歉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14489"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“上次的事，对不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，她向我们这些小孩子郑重地低下了头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“虽然是我误会了……但你们明明是在做好事，我却用很差劲的态度对待你们。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“所以想来跟你们道歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不用在意的，误会这种事谁都会有。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14383"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是呀，我们没关系的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“可是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请把头抬起来吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“……真的，非常抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她这么说着，依然不肯抬头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……这下可麻烦了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那个……您说的是什么事呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我们可没有遇到过这种事哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“至少我们在捡垃圾的时候，从来没有遇到过谁对我们态度不好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13852"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就算有过，我也已经不记得了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13959"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“所以说，那根本就是小事一桩啦♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说着，露出了平常那样的笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“嗯……谢谢你们。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她又低下了头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“这个，虽然也算不上赔礼，请你们收下一起吃吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那、那个……如果是赔礼的话，我们可不敢收哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“那就当作是对你们捡垃圾这件事的奖励怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样的话……就交给捡了很多垃圾的紬来判断吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14524"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾!؟我可以收下吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“如果不收下的话……这东西可就真要变成垃圾了哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14470"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那也就是说，不管怎样都会跑到我的手上呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“既然如此，我就不客气地收下了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“嗯，谢谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬接过了点心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到紬两眼放光的样子，阿姨似乎松了口气，笑眯眯地走了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13779"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是个很好的人呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还以为又要挨骂了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没想到她会对我们这些小孩子，如此郑重地低头道歉。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14377"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就像静久说的那样，其实她只是一时没有台阶可下而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是的呢，不愧是静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13782"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，就算这么夸我，我也已经不记得了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，她露出了笑容。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14377"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好了，该吃咖喱了哦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的声音充满了活力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是因为被夸奖而高兴吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是因为把海之家打扫干净了而高兴吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是因为看到紬开心的样子而高兴呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过……看着这样的静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也感到很高兴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，说起来静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“什么事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然我知道你想要让海之家重新开张。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过为什么会在这个暑假开始做这件事呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“呵呵♪　这个嘛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也许是因为遇到了紬吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14528"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13852"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你不觉得紬给人一种很自由的感觉吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13894"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“比如会用吕客薯片的空罐子来搭建阳台。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……做的事情还真是惊人啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13898"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“暑假给人的感觉大概就是这样吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“做一些也不知道有没有意义的事情……但就是很开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我想做的就是这样的事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14530"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“用吕客薯片做阳台不可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14470"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“如果可以的话，现在就出发去那里也……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13933"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“可惜呀，毕竟羽依里来了海之家这边呢～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13852"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊。其实我做什么都无所谓的，但既然羽依里都来帮忙了，我就想把这件事给做好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“还有就是……想让我最喜欢的两个朋友，也体会一下我最爱的海之家熙熙攘攘的样子♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14420"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾！很想体会哦♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13849"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“还有……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久怀念地望向海之家的内里。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i398"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13783"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我也不想让大家……忘掉这个海之家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13795"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“考虑到自己的未来，这件事大概只有今年夏天有机会做了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13814"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“如果升学的话，我应该就要去别的地方了。如果找工作的话，暑假的时间就很有限了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13856"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“只有现在能做这件事了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13897"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“所以，我想在这个夏天让海之家重新开业……把它留在大家的记忆之中。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里对静久来说……是一个不愿忘记的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时，也更是个不希望其他人忘记的地方啊……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过了一会儿……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“可以打扰一下吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是天善啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我有件事想跟水织学姐商量。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果是找静久的话，她现在在厨房哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“顺便，我把鱼带过来了。是良一让我送来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13863"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“刚才是不是有人说‘送奶的’？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没有人说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15026"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“水、水织学姐！您、您好……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，你好♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15023"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“其、其实……我有一件事想找您请教！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当然可以哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过，我……对乒乓球不太了解，不知道能出给什么建议呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“并不是想找您咨询乒乓球。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，是这样吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“水织学姐……您该不会以为，我是个只懂乒乓球的男人吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“要吃咖喱吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我不客气了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他这转移话题的功力和容易上当的程度都很不得了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，我和紬就在外面吃着咖喱等你们了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1597"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我们开始吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“拜托了！”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"趁着静久听天善讲话的时候，我和紬吃起了咖喱。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14380"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“今天也很好吃呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，明天的肯定也会很好吃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14422"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我还听说，咖喱放一晚上会变得更好吃呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在这一点上，确实要比炒饭强啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14469"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是呢！咖喱真是太棒了！”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，等我们吃完收拾好的时候。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13852"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“非常感谢！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯。那么，加油哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15029"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“是的！我加纳天善……一定会全力以赴的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15035"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呜啊啊啊啊啊！特训啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，天善便跑着步回去了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14545"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你们都聊了些什么呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13930"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“关于乒乓球的事哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这不就是个只懂乒乓球的男人吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善果然就是天善。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我稍微记一下笔记，你们等一下哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久把大概是说给天善的话记在了便利贴上。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13763"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唔……这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明只是把刚才的应对方法记下来而已，为什么她会这么烦恼的？"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13763"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘即使是无用之事，也要全力表示支持’。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好尖锐啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊！不、不是的！这不是说加纳同学的事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她写的不是对天善的应对方法吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13873"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？说起来，你没有把给我开导的记录写下来吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13870"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那、那些是只有对羽依里才会做的事哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13884"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这、这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是啊，当然不会对谁都把胸贴上去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13867"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知为什么脸有点发烫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来……她只会对我那样吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微松了口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我为什么要松口气啊……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬也偷偷瞄了一眼。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“写得很认真呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“除了奶子之外还写了一些其他的事情，有点意外呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13791"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“――!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13911"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我、我居然忘记给出建议的时候用奶子来打比方了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就不必了吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“咖喱没吃完呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14524"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“还剩下好多呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13870"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因为前几次大家都过来玩了，所以我多做了不少。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要不要我带回去？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13941"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……没问题吗？家里有没有炒饭派的人？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“炒饭派……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有个超爱炒饭的孩子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不用勉强，我们去找其他喜欢咖喱的人吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这事有这么严重吗……？"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们三个边走边寻找愿意收下咖喱的人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"遇到了白羽。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13373"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13782"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀♪你好，白乳同学。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14446"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你好呀，西瓜棒小姐。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13287"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你好……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总感觉你有好多种称呼啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“第一次听到有人叫我白乳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13244"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“总觉得不太想回应。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“感觉到了某种不妙的气息……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那就像平时那样吧……鸣濑同学。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13914"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“现在我们在找人收走没吃完的咖喱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“咖喱……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你爱吃咖喱吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13250"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“也没有不爱吃……只是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“和炒饭比起来的话，可能稍微差一点。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来如此。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不过……闻起来很香。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“要不要尝尝看？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久这么说着打开了盖子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13367"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这个香味……这些配料……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这道菜……毫无疑问就是鸡白咖喱！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13782"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是的，没错。为了让海之家重新开业，我重现了那道咖喱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13441"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“没想到这种东西还存在于岛上……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“说‘这种东西’，对食物和制作这道菜的人可能有点失礼……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她好讲礼貌啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13398"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜呜……看起来真的好好吃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这样下去，炒饭在岛上的地位可能会不保。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"地位……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家对炒饭有点热衷过头了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对炒饭抱有这么强烈的自豪感，真是有点佩服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么……她会收下咖喱吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“西瓜棒小姐。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这道咖喱真的非常美味。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，我知道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“请你一定要品尝一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13262"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"意外地很轻易就收下了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她对紬没辙啊……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明明刚才还说得像是敌人一样。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13244"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“摸清敌人的底细，才可以百战百胜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13262"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“说‘敌人’……对食物和制作这道菜的人可能有些言重了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然还是很讲礼貌。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13370"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那我就收下了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13819"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好的，希望你能好好品尝一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13781"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这个夏天我应该会一直待在海之家，如果可以的话，请告诉我你的感想哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我、我会妥善处理的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，咖喱被白羽收下了。"},{"op":"set","variable":405,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]